<title>SPAIN: Bouygues sold 1.88 pct in BCH - press.</title>
<headline>Bouygues sold 1.88 pct in BCH - press.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>French construction group Bouygues has sold a 1.88 percent stake of Banco Central Hispano in three separate tranches since July for 8.69 billion pesetas, a Spanish daily reported on Friday.</p>
<p>Financial daily Expansion said Bouygues still held a 1.21 percent stake in BCH, while BCH has a 3.03 pct stake in the French group.</p>
<p>Citing Bouygues' sources, the daily said the decision to sell had been spurred by a need for cash to finance acquisitions in the French telecommunications industry.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
